  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "炭黑底白字的主要按鈕；所有 CTA 都用它。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\">儲存</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-primary{background:var(--c-action,#1F2328);color:#fff;border:1px solid var(--c-action,#1F2328);border-radius:8px;min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;font:500 14px 'PingFang TC','Noto Sans TC',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s,border-color .2s}.ds-btn-primary:hover{background:var(--c-action-hover,#353B43);border-color:var(--c-action-hover,#353B43)}.ds-btn-primary:active{background:var(--c-action-active,#121417);border-color:var(--c-action-active,#121417)}.ds-btn-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--c-action,#1F2328);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Icon Ghost Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-icon-ghost",
      "description": "列表列動作與標題旁新增鈕：透明底、muted 圖示；hover / focus 時 neutral-fill 底 + ink 圖示。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-icon\" aria-label=\"新增\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M8 3v10M3 8h10\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-icon{width:28px;height:28px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:transparent;color:var(--c-muted,#636970);cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s}.ds-btn-icon:hover,.ds-btn-icon:focus-visible{background:var(--c-neutral-fill,#F3F4F6);color:var(--c-ink,#1C1F23)}.ds-btn-icon:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--c-action,#1F2328);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Chip",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "chip",
      "description": "快速選日期、類別、名稱；選中為炭黑 action 實心。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-chips\"><button class=\"ds-chip is-active\">今天</button><button class=\"ds-chip\">昨天</button><button class=\"ds-chip\">餐飲</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-chips{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap}.ds-chip{min-height:36px;padding:0 14px;border:1px solid var(--c-line-strong,#DADDE2);border-radius:999px;background:#fff;color:var(--c-ink,#1C1F23);font:400 14px 'PingFang TC','Noto Sans TC',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-chip:hover{border-color:var(--c-action,#1F2328)}.ds-chip.is-active{background:var(--c-action,#1F2328);border-color:var(--c-action,#1F2328);color:#fff}.ds-chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--c-action,#1F2328);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mobile Tab Bar",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "tabbar",
      "description": "浮在左下的膠囊導覽；Float 陰影。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-tabbar\"><button class=\"ds-tab is-on\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"><path d=\"M3 9l7-6 7 6v8H3z\"/></svg><span>資產總覽</span></button><button class=\"ds-tab\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"><path d=\"M4 16V9M10 16V4M16 16v-5\"/></svg><span>支出分析</span></button><button class=\"ds-tab\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"><circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"M10 2v3M10 15v3M2 10h3M15 10h3\"/></svg><span>設定</span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-tabbar{display:inline-flex;gap:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);border:1px solid var(--c-line,#EBEDF0);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(28,31,35,.14);backdrop-filter:blur(8px)}.ds-tab{min-height:44px;padding:0 12px;display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:2px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:transparent;color:var(--c-muted,#636970);font:400 12px 'PingFang TC','Noto Sans TC',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-tab.is-on{background:var(--c-track,#EDEFF2);color:var(--c-ink,#1C1F23)}.ds-tab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--c-action,#1F2328);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Expense FAB",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "fab",
      "description": "右下記一筆支出；唯一圓形浮動按鈕。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-fab\" aria-label=\"記一筆\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M11 4v14M4 11h14\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-fab{width:52px;height:52px;border:0;border-radius:999px;background:var(--c-action,#1F2328);color:#fff;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(28,31,35,.14);cursor:pointer;transition:box-shadow .2s,background .2s}.ds-fab:hover,.ds-fab:focus-visible{background:var(--c-action-hover,#353B43);box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(28,31,35,.2)}.ds-fab:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--c-action,#1F2328);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Grouped List",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "list-group",
      "description": "依日分組的支出列表：灰底分組標題、72px 列、左側分類圖示 tile。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-list\"><div class=\"ds-list-head\"><span>10/08 週四</span><b>$1,280</b></div><div class=\"ds-list-row\"><span class=\"ds-tile\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 3v6a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V3M8 3v18M17 21V3c-2 1-3 4-3 7s1 4 3 4\"/></svg></span><div class=\"ds-list-main\"><div class=\"ds-list-name\">午餐</div><div class=\"ds-list-meta\">外食 · Po</div></div><div class=\"ds-list-amt\">$180</div></div><div class=\"ds-list-row\"><span class=\"ds-tile\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 17h14M6 17l1.5-6h9L18 17M7 17v2M17 17v2M8 14h.01M16 14h.01\"/></svg></span><div class=\"ds-list-main\"><div class=\"ds-list-name\">加油</div><div class=\"ds-list-meta\">交通費 · Wei</div></div><div class=\"ds-list-amt\">$1,100</div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-list{width:340px;border:1px solid var(--c-line,#EBEDF0);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;font:400 14px 'PingFang TC','Noto Sans TC',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--c-ink,#1C1F23)}.ds-list-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 16px;background:var(--c-neutral-fill,#F3F4F6);color:var(--c-muted,#636970);font-size:12px}.ds-list-head b{color:var(--c-ink,#1C1F23);font-weight:600}.ds-list-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;min-height:72px;padding:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--c-line,#EBEDF0)}.ds-tile{flex:none;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--c-neutral-fill,#F3F4F6);color:var(--c-ink,#1C1F23)}.ds-list-main{flex:1;min-width:0}.ds-list-meta{margin-top:2px;font-size:12px;color:var(--c-muted,#636970)}.ds-list-amt{font-weight:600}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Budget Bar",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "progress-track",
      "description": "預算條：平時中灰，接近上限 warn、超支 down；直線標示今天應花到的位置。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-budget\"><div class=\"ds-budget-top\"><span>餐飲</span><b>剩 NT$ 3,200</b></div><div class=\"ds-bar\"><i class=\"ds-bar-c\" style=\"width:48%\"></i><i class=\"ds-bar-u\" style=\"left:48%;width:12%\"></i><i class=\"ds-bar-p\" style=\"left:55%\"></i></div><div class=\"ds-budget-meta\">已花 NT$ 4,800 / 8,000</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-budget{width:320px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;font:400 14px 'PingFang TC','Noto Sans TC',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--c-ink,#1C1F23)}.ds-budget-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline}.ds-budget-top b{font-size:16px;font-weight:600}.ds-bar{position:relative;height:8px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--c-track,#EDEFF2)}.ds-bar i{position:absolute;top:0;bottom:0}.ds-bar-c{left:0;background:var(--c-muted,#636970);border-radius:999px 0 0 999px}.ds-bar-u{background:var(--c-muted,#636970);opacity:.35}.ds-bar-p{top:-2px!important;bottom:-2px!important;width:2px;margin-left:-1px;background:var(--c-ink,#1C1F23);opacity:.6}.ds-budget-meta{font-size:12px;color:var(--c-muted,#636970)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Savings Hero",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "hero",
      "description": "支出頁 hero：標籤 → display 總支出 → hero 下唯一帶色的標記「存下 N%」翡翠膠囊（teal-soft 底、teal-ink 字、12px 600；超支時退回純 down 字）→ 存錢塔。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-hero\"><div class=\"ds-hero-label\">2026 年 10 月・總支出</div><div class=\"ds-hero-num\"><span class=\"ds-hero-cur\">$</span>48,712</div><div class=\"ds-hero-sub\">存下 72.9%</div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-hero{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;font-family:'PingFang TC','Noto Sans TC',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-hero-label{font-size:14px;color:var(--c-muted,#636970)}.ds-hero-num{margin-top:4px;font-size:38px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.8px;line-height:1.15;color:var(--c-ink,#1C1F23)}.ds-hero-cur{color:var(--c-subtle,#8B9198)}.ds-hero-sub{margin-top:8px;padding:2px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--c-teal-soft,#BDEFE0);color:var(--c-teal-ink,#00715C);font-size:12px;font-weight:600}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Savings Tower",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": null,
      "description": "支出頁主角：沒有底色的圓角色塊，由上而下為定期（teal-tint）、單筆（teal-soft）、存下（teal）；塊與塊之間 2 的縫、內側圓角 6、外側圓角 14。花掉的部分進場時碎成小塊掉落。",
      "html": "<svg class=\"ds-tower\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 150\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"存錢塔：定期 25%、單筆 13%、存下 62%\"><defs><clipPath id=\"ds-tower-clip\"><rect x=\"22\" y=\"14\" width=\"76\" height=\"136\" rx=\"14\"/></clipPath></defs><g clip-path=\"url(#ds-tower-clip)\"><rect class=\"ds-tower-recurring\" x=\"22\" y=\"14\" width=\"76\" height=\"33\" rx=\"6\"/><rect class=\"ds-tower-onetime\" x=\"22\" y=\"49\" width=\"76\" height=\"15.7\" rx=\"6\"/><rect class=\"ds-tower-saved\" x=\"22\" y=\"66.7\" width=\"76\" height=\"83.3\" rx=\"6\"/></g></svg>",
      "css": ".ds-tower{width:120px;height:150px}.ds-tower rect{transition:opacity .2s}.ds-tower-recurring{fill:var(--c-teal-tint,#74DDBF)}.ds-tower-onetime{fill:var(--c-teal-soft,#BDEFE0)}.ds-tower-saved{fill:var(--c-teal,#00957A)}.ds-tower:hover .ds-tower-recurring,.ds-tower:hover .ds-tower-onetime{opacity:.3}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Month Bars",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": null,
      "description": "支出頁月份選擇：固定 Jan–Dec，每月一樣高（track 底），從下往上的 teal-tint 是存下比例，選中轉 teal；未到的月份停用。下方置中「累計」膠囊，開啟時炭黑。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-months\"><div class=\"ds-months-track\"><button class=\"ds-month\"><span class=\"ds-month-bar\"><i style=\"height:94%\"></i></span><span class=\"ds-month-label\">Jan</span></button><button class=\"ds-month\"><span class=\"ds-month-bar\"><i style=\"height:54%\"></i></span><span class=\"ds-month-label\">Feb</span></button><button class=\"ds-month\"><span class=\"ds-month-bar\"><i style=\"height:24%\"></i></span><span class=\"ds-month-label\">Mar</span></button><button class=\"ds-month\"><span class=\"ds-month-bar\"><i style=\"height:70%\"></i></span><span class=\"ds-month-label\">Apr</span></button><button class=\"ds-month\"><span class=\"ds-month-bar\"><i style=\"height:72%\"></i></span><span class=\"ds-month-label\">May</span></button><button class=\"ds-month\"><span class=\"ds-month-bar\"><i style=\"height:72%\"></i></span><span class=\"ds-month-label\">Jun</span></button><button class=\"ds-month\"><span class=\"ds-month-bar\"><i style=\"height:74%\"></i></span><span class=\"ds-month-label\">Jul</span></button><button class=\"ds-month\"><span class=\"ds-month-bar\"><i style=\"height:74%\"></i></span><span class=\"ds-month-label\">Aug</span></button><button class=\"ds-month\"><span class=\"ds-month-bar\"><i style=\"height:66%\"></i></span><span class=\"ds-month-label\">Sep</span></button><button class=\"ds-month is-on is-current\"><span class=\"ds-month-bar\"><i style=\"height:73%\"></i></span><span class=\"ds-month-label\">Oct</span></button><button class=\"ds-month is-empty\" disabled><span class=\"ds-month-bar\"></span><span class=\"ds-month-label\">Nov</span></button><button class=\"ds-month is-empty\" disabled><span class=\"ds-month-bar\"></span><span class=\"ds-month-label\">Dec</span></button></div><button class=\"ds-months-all\">累計</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-months{width:340px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;gap:12px;font:400 12px 'PingFang TC','Noto Sans TC',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-months-track{display:flex}.ds-month{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:0 3px;border:0;background:none;font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.ds-month-bar{position:relative;display:block;height:40px;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--c-track,#EDEFF2)}.ds-month-bar i{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;border-radius:6px;background:var(--c-teal-tint,#74DDBF);transition:background .25s}.ds-month-label{line-height:1;color:var(--c-muted,#636970)}.ds-month.is-current .ds-month-label{color:var(--c-ink,#1C1F23);font-weight:600}.ds-month.is-on .ds-month-bar i{background:var(--c-teal,#00957A)}.ds-month.is-on .ds-month-label{color:var(--c-teal-ink,#00715C)}.ds-month:hover .ds-month-bar i{background:var(--c-teal,#00957A)}.ds-month.is-empty{cursor:default}.ds-month.is-empty .ds-month-bar{background:transparent;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--c-line,#EBEDF0)}.ds-month.is-empty .ds-month-label{color:var(--c-subtle,#8B9198)}.ds-month:focus-visible,.ds-months-all:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--c-action,#1F2328);outline-offset:2px}.ds-months-all{align-self:center;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid var(--c-line-strong,#DADDE2);border-radius:999px;background:transparent;color:var(--c-muted,#636970);font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.ds-months-all:hover,.ds-months-all.is-on{background:var(--c-action,#1F2328);border-color:var(--c-action,#1F2328);color:#fff}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Quick Expense Keypad",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "keypad-key",
      "description": "快速記一筆的底部：常用支出格（三欄、line-strong 框、radius-md）、鍵盤正上方的「加入常用支出」切換 chip（Star + aria-pressed，開啟同選中的 chip），以及 4 欄數字鍵盤（1px line 縫、52px 鍵、action 存檔鍵）。",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-qe\"><div class=\"ds-qe-grid\"><button class=\"ds-qe-tpl is-on\"><b>早餐</b><small>餐飲</small></button><button class=\"ds-qe-tpl\"><b>加油</b><small>交通</small></button><button class=\"ds-qe-tpl\"><b>停車</b><small>$60</small></button></div><div class=\"ds-qe-save\"><button class=\"ds-qe-toggle\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8.587 8.236l2.598-5.232a.911.911 0 011.63 0l2.598 5.232 5.808.844a.902.902 0 01.503 1.542l-4.202 4.07.992 5.75c.127.738-.653 1.3-1.32.952L12 18.678l-5.195 2.716c-.666.349-1.446-.214-1.319-.953l.992-5.75-4.202-4.07a.902.902 0 01.503-1.54l5.808-.845z\"/></svg>加入常用支出</button></div><div class=\"ds-qe-keys\"><button class=\"ds-key\">7</button><button class=\"ds-key\">8</button><button class=\"ds-key\">9</button><button class=\"ds-key\">⌫</button><button class=\"ds-key\">4</button><button class=\"ds-key\">5</button><button class=\"ds-key\">6</button><button class=\"ds-key\">+</button><button class=\"ds-key\">1</button><button class=\"ds-key\">2</button><button class=\"ds-key\">3</button><button class=\"ds-key\">−</button><button class=\"ds-key\">C</button><button class=\"ds-key\">0</button><button class=\"ds-key\">00</button><button class=\"ds-key ds-key-save\">存</button></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-qe{width:340px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;background:var(--c-surface,#FFFFFF);font:400 14px 'PingFang TC','Noto Sans TC',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;color:var(--c-ink,#1C1F23);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-qe-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;padding:0 16px}.ds-qe-tpl{min-height:52px;padding:8px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center;gap:2px;border:1px solid var(--c-line-strong,#DADDE2);border-radius:8px;background:var(--c-surface,#FFFFFF);color:inherit;font:inherit;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}.ds-qe-tpl b{font-weight:400}.ds-qe-tpl small{font-size:12px;color:var(--c-muted,#636970)}.ds-qe-tpl.is-on{background:var(--c-action,#1F2328);border-color:var(--c-action,#1F2328);color:#fff}.ds-qe-tpl.is-on small{color:inherit}.ds-qe-save{display:flex;padding:0 16px}.ds-qe-toggle{min-height:36px;padding:0 14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;border:1px solid var(--c-line-strong,#DADDE2);border-radius:999px;background:var(--c-surface,#FFFFFF);color:var(--c-ink,#1C1F23);font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.ds-qe-toggle[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--c-action,#1F2328);border-color:var(--c-action,#1F2328);color:#fff}.ds-qe-toggle:focus-visible,.ds-qe-tpl:focus-visible,.ds-key:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--c-action,#1F2328);outline-offset:2px}.ds-qe-keys{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--c-line,#EBEDF0);border-top:1px solid var(--c-line,#EBEDF0)}.ds-key{min-height:52px;border:0;background:var(--c-surface,#FFFFFF);color:var(--c-ink,#1C1F23);font:inherit;font-size:20px;cursor:pointer}.ds-key:active{background:var(--c-neutral-fill,#F3F4F6)}.ds-key-save{background:var(--c-action,#1F2328);color:#fff;font-weight:600}.ds-key-save:active{background:var(--c-action-active,#121417)}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "安靜的帳本，會動的存錢罐",
    "overview": "介面的預設狀態是一本安靜的家用帳本：冷灰紙色的底、炭黑的控制項、細線分隔、平面的元件，畫面上唯一大聲的東西是置中的大數字。打開 App 的人要在幾秒內讀到「全家有多少錢、這個月花了多少」，所以外框退後，數字向前。\n\n帳本裡只住一種有生命的東西：存錢的主角。資產頁的淨資產罐（淡底色的罐身，前後兩層水波、漲跌色帶、突破千萬的氣泡）、支出頁的存錢塔與累計成長塔（沒有底色的圓角色塊，花掉的部分碎成小塊掉落）、可點的月份長條。它們是 App 情緒的核心，有實體感、會動、可互動；其餘一切都保持安靜。\n\n密度偏手機單手：主要觸控目標 44px 以上，表單在底部 sheet 中完成，主導覽是浮在左下的膠囊 tab bar，記一筆支出的 FAB 在右下。桌面使用同一套元件，只是內容區最寬 1200px。\n\n**Bold where it counts（2026-10-15）：** 按鈕、tab、表格、列表維持炭黑與冷灰；大膽的顏色只花在表現產品個性的少數地方：存錢視覺（飽和的翡翠綠）、支出頁的「存下 N%」膠囊、分類圖示 tile、holder tag 與圖表色。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "中性冷灰撐起整個介面，結構灰（線、框、底色）刻意壓得很淡，像紙上的印線而不是線稿；所有 CTA 是炭黑（不是純黑）；teal 只留給存錢視覺，所以一出現就知道是「存下來的錢」。",
      "大數字置中、粗體、等寬數字，是每個主頁的視覺錨點。",
      "表面全平；只有浮在內容上方的東西（FAB、tab bar、overlay）有陰影。",
      "每頁至多一個「存錢罐」級的主角視覺，擁有實體感與動畫。",
      "所有金額使用 tabular-nums，欄位對齊。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Living Thing Rule",
        "body": "每個頁面最多一個有實體感、會動的主角，而且它必須在表現「錢存下來、錢累積」。其他元素一律安靜、平面、靜止。判斷新設計時問：「這是帳本，還是存錢罐？」答不出是存錢罐，就照帳本做。",
        "section": "overview"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Loud Number Rule",
        "body": "一個畫面只有一個 display 級的數字。次要數字降為 subhead 或 body，用顏色（漲跌）而不是字級表達差異。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Saved-Money Color Rule",
        "body": "Teal 只代表「存下來的錢」。可操作的強調用炭黑 `action` 或字重，不要用 teal，也不要引入新色相（唯一的例外是下面的分類底色）。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Semantic-Only Rule",
        "body": "`up` / `down` / `warn` 只表達財務或動作的語意（漲跌、超支、危險），不當裝飾色使用。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Readable-Grey Rule",
        "body": "小字（≤16px）的灰只用 `muted`。`subtle` 對比只有 3:1，只留給大字、停用狀態與非文字元素。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Weight-Not-Size Rule",
        "body": "在 body 與 subhead 之間，用 600 字重而不是新字級拉出層級，不另開 13px。hero 的次要行：資產頁的漲跌用 body 600；支出頁的「存下 N%」是 12px 600 的翡翠膠囊（`teal-soft` 底、`teal-ink` 字，4.7:1），是 hero 數字下唯一帶色的標記；超支時退回純 `down` 字，不加膠囊。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Only-Floating-Things-Cast-Shadows Rule",
        "body": "按鈕、卡片、列表、輸入框在任何狀態下都沒有陰影（antd 的 button shadow 已在 theme 關掉）。會有陰影的只有真的浮在內容上方的元件；例外是「本月預計」卡與資產頁兩個持有人列表的 Card 陰影，以及持有人標題展開時的 Heading 陰影。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 只使用 frontmatter / `src/theme/tokens.js` 中的 token；CSS 中以 `var(--c-*)`、`var(--fs-*)`、`var(--radius-*)`、`var(--space-*)` 取用。",
      "Do 區塊之間用 `--space-section`，區塊標題到內容用 `--space-section-head`，列表列用 `--space-row-*`。",
      "Do 每頁只放一個 display 級大數字，並置中於 hero。",
      "Do 所有金額使用 tabular-nums。",
      "Do 手機上可點目標至少 44px，表單放在 bottom sheet。",
      "Do 讓陰影只出現在 FAB、tab bar、overlay。",
      "Do 為所有動畫提供 `prefers-reduced-motion` 關閉路徑。",
      "Do 漲跌、超支、警示只用 `up` / `down` / `warn`。",
      "Do 圖示只用 `iconoir-react`，尺寸只用 `--icon-sm` / `--icon-md`。",
      "Do 所有 CTA、選中狀態、focus 用炭黑 `action`；teal 只用在存錢視覺。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 在按鈕、卡片、列表上加陰影。",
      "Don't 在同一頁放第二個會動的主角視覺（The One Living Thing Rule）。",
      "Don't 新增刻度外的字級或間距（5、10、14、18px 這類）；需要新刻度先更新 token。",
      "Don't 用 `subtle` 寫需要被讀的小字。",
      "Don't 用回彈 / overshoot 的 easing。",
      "Don't 把 teal 用在按鈕、chip、連結、tag、圖示等非存錢的元素上；也不要用純黑 `#000`。",
      "Don't 在同一處混用 antd 與 iconoir 圖示，或為了裝飾到處加圖示；圖示要幫助辨識（分類、動作、導覽）。"
    ]
  }
}
